Package: nekobox
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: pkexec
Description: Qt proxy client with its sing-box core
 NekoBox is a Qt-based proxy configuration manager for sing-box based
 cores. It imports subscription links, stores profiles, tests latency and
 runs the selected configuration through a local core process.
 .
 This package ships both the graphical client and the core executable under
 /usr/libexec/Iblis, so the GUI always finds the core it was built against.
 It deliberately does not install the /usr/bin/sing-box compatibility
 wrapper, so it can coexist with a standalone sing-box package.
